Steps:
[HTTP] GET {{BACK_URL}}/api/search/indexes
[SETUP] Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
[ASSERT] response received

[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/pricing/pricelists
[SETUP] Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
[SETUP] Content-Type: application/json
[SETUP] body: {"name": "BSM-Smoke-PriceList", "currency": "USD", "description": "Smoke test price list"}
[ASSERT] price list created
[HTTP] DELETE {{BACK_URL}}/api/pricing/pricelists/<new_pricelist_id>

[HTTP] GET {{BACK_URL}}/api/inventory/products/{{test_sku}}?fulfillmentCenterId={{ffc_id}}
[SETUP] Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
[ASSERT] record found, capture current inStockQuantity as baseline
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/inventory/products
[SETUP] body: [{"sku": "{{test_sku}}", "fulfillmentCenterId": "{{ffc_id}}", "inStockQuantity": <baseline + 1>}]
[HTTP] GET same endpoint again

[HTTP] GET {{BACK_URL}}/api/catalog/products?productType=Configurable&take=3
[SETUP] Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
[ADMIN] if results non-empty: open the first configurable product in Admin blade

Assertions:
[GRID] at most 1–2 product rows visible, all related to {{known_sku}}
[DOM] SKU column of the returned row shows {{known_sku}} (exact or partial match)
[GRID] no obviously unrelated rows visible
